flowchart TD
    Start[Calling external HTTP service] --> Typed{One cohesive client abstraction?}
    Typed -->|Yes| TypedClient[Typed HttpClient]
    Typed -->|No| Named{Many endpoints sharing policy?}
    Named -->|Yes| NamedClient[Named HttpClient]
    Named -->|No| Generated{Contract-first API?}
    Generated -->|Yes| GeneratedClient[Generated or Refit client]
    Generated -->|No| TypedClient
